<section class="tour-section faq-section">
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="tour-faq">
    <details class="tour-faq-item" open>
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">How do I book and when do I pay?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Booking is fast and flexible via WhatsApp ({{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}). For private airport and hotel transfers, zero advance deposit is required — you pay your driver upon arrival. For maritime excursions (Safari Blue, Mnemba, Prison Island, Catamaran), we require a modest 20% advance deposit via a secure DPO or Pesapal payment link sent to you on WhatsApp (Visa/Mastercard) to lock in your boat captain, fuel, and fresh morning seafood lunch, with the remaining 80% balance paid on the day of the tour.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="tour-faq-item">
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">Are marine park and conservation fees included?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Yes! All official Zanzibar government conservation fees (such as the Menai Bay Marine Reserve levy, Mnemba conservation fee, or Jozani National Park ranger fee) are fully included upfront in our planning rates. You will never experience surprise cash demands at the boat or park gates.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="tour-faq-item">
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">What is your cancellation and weather policy?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        We offer 100% free cancellation up to 24 hours before your tour with a full refund of any deposit paid. Because fresh seafood is procured at dawn and boat captains are pre-booked, cancellations within 24 hours forfeit the 20% deposit. However, under our <strong>Captain's Weather Guarantee</strong>, if the Zanzibar Maritime Authority or our captains advise against sailing due to heavy swells or adverse weather, you receive an immediate 100% full refund or free priority reschedule.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="tour-faq-item">
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">Is hotel pickup and drop-off included?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Yes. Private, air-conditioned vehicle transfers can be bundled door-to-door from any resort in Zanzibar — including Stone Town, Nungwi, Kendwa, Paje, Jambiani, Kiwengwa, and Matemwe. Your assigned driver coordinates directly with you on WhatsApp.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="tour-faq-item">
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">Do you offer multilingual drivers and tour guides?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Yes! All standard tours and transfers are conducted in fluent English and Swahili. For an additional fee, we offer certified multilingual Zanzibari tour guides and drivers fluent in Italian, German, French, and Polish upon advance request. Please indicate your preferred language when requesting your quote so our operations team can assign your dedicated guide in advance.
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
